function showEmptyForWorkspace(){const quality=activeModule==='quality',compare=activeView==='compare';renderWorkspaceEmpty(quality?(compare?'当前暂无资源对照记录':'当前暂无单资源测试记录'):(compare?'当前暂无对照实验记录':'当前暂无单次压测记录'),quality?(compare?'创建资源 A 与资源 B 的对照评测后，结果会出现在评测记录中。':'创建单资源评测后，结果会出现在评测记录中。'):(compare?'创建一个对照实验后，结果会出现在压测记录中。':'创建一次网关压测后，结果会出现在压测记录中。'),quality?(compare?"openQualityCreate('compare')":"openQualityCreate('single')"):(compare?"openGatewayCreate('compare')":"openGatewayCreate('single')"))}
function formatAccountDate(value){if(!value)return '—';try{return new Date(Number(value)*1000).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'})}catch{return '—'}}
async function openAccountModal(){if(currentUser?.role!=='admin')return;const modal=$('accountModal');openModal('accountModal');$('accountStatus').textContent='';try{const d=await api('/admin/accounts');$('accountList').innerHTML=(d.accounts||[]).map(a=>`<div class="account-row"><b>${esc(a.username)}</b><span class="role-badge ${a.role==='admin'?'admin':''}">${a.role==='admin'?'管理员':'使用者'}</span><span class="created-at">${formatAccountDate(a.created_at)}</span><button class="account-delete" type="button" data-click-action="deleteAccount" data-arg0="${esc(a.username)}" ${a.username===currentUser.username?'disabled':''}>删除</button></div>`).join('')||'<div class="field-hint">暂无账号。</div>'}catch(e){$('accountList').innerHTML=`<div class="auth-error">${esc(e.message)}</div>`}}
function closeAccountModal(){closeModal('accountModal')}
async function deleteAccount(username){if(!confirm(`确认删除账号“${username}”？该账号将立即无法登录。`))return;try{await api('/admin/accounts?delete='+encodeURIComponent(username),{method:'POST'});toast('账号已删除');openAccountModal()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
$('accountCreateForm').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const status=$('accountStatus'),button=e.target.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');button.disabled=true;status.className='form-status';status.textContent='正在创建账号…';try{const d=await api('/admin/accounts',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({username:$('newUsername').value.trim(),password:$('newPassword').value,role:$('newRole').value})});status.className='form-status ok';status.textContent=`已创建账号 ${d.account?.username||''}，请安全分发初始密码。`;$('newUsername').value='';$('newPassword').value='';openAccountModal()}catch(err){status.className='form-status error';status.textContent=err.message}finally{button.disabled=false}});
function showLoading(){$('loadingState').hidden=false;$('empty').hidden=true;$('detail').hidden=true;$('modulePlaceholder').hidden=true}
function showEmpty(){showEmptyForWorkspace()}
async function refresh(){if(!authenticated||refreshing)return;refreshing=true;const seq=++refreshSeq;try{const kind=selectedQuality?'quality_tests':selectedComparison?'comparisons':selectedRouting?'routing_comparisons':'tasks';const id=selectedQuality||selectedComparison||selectedRouting||selected||'';const d=await api('/tasks?summary=1&kind='+kind+'&selected='+encodeURIComponent(id));lastPollAt=Date.now();if(seq!==refreshSeq)return;const currentId=selectedQuality||selectedComparison||selectedRouting||selected||'';if(id!==currentId){refreshing=false;return refresh()}tasks=d.tasks||[];comparisons=d.comparisons||[];qualityTests=d.quality_tests||[];routingComparisons=d.routing_comparisons||[];window.FingerprintUI?.setRuns(d.fingerprint_runs||[],d.fingerprint_storage_warnings||[]);hasActiveRuns=[...tasks,...comparisons,...qualityTests,...routingComparisons,...(d.fingerprint_runs||[])].some(x=>['running','waiting','stopping','collecting','queued'].includes(x.status));$('health').classList.remove('conn-bad');$('healthText').textContent='服务正常';const signature=JSON.stringify([d,activeModule,activeView,selected,selectedQuality,selectedComparison,selectedRouting]);if(signature===lastRefreshSignature)return;lastRefreshSignature=signature;try{renderWorkspace()}catch(renderError){console.error('[render] failed',renderError);$('loadingState').hidden=true;$('detail').hidden=true;$('modulePlaceholder').hidden=true;$('empty').hidden=false;$('emptyTitle').textContent='详情显示异常';$('emptyHint').textContent='服务数据已读取，但页面渲染失败：'+renderError.message}}catch(e){if(seq!==refreshSeq)return;if(/请先登录|401|登录/.test(e.message||'')){authenticated=false;currentUser=null;updateAccountChrome();authGate(true,false);return}console.error('[refresh] failed',e);if(seq===refreshSeq){$('health').classList.add('conn-bad');$('healthText').textContent='连接失败';$('loadingState').hidden=true;$('detail').hidden=true;$('modulePlaceholder').hidden=true;$('empty').hidden=false;$('emptyTitle').textContent='测试记录加载失败';$('emptyHint').textContent=e.message||'无法读取测试记录，请确认本地服务已启动后重试。'}}finally{if(seq===refreshSeq)refreshing=false}}
function selectTask(id){selected=id;detailTask=null;selectedComparison=null;selectedQuality=null;activeModule='gateway';localStorage.setItem('route_selected_task',id);detailState.id=null;toggleConfig(false);updateWorkspaceChrome();renderWorkspace();refresh()}
async function openGroupTask(id){try{detailTask=await api('/task/'+id);selected=null;selectedComparison=null;selectedQuality=null;activeModule='gateway';detailState.id=null;toggleConfig(false);updateWorkspaceChrome();renderWorkspace()}catch(e){toast(e.message||'无法读取实验组明细')}}
function render(d){if(d._summary){showLoading();return refresh()}window.detailReceivedAt=Date.now();window.currentDetail=d;$('loadingState').hidden=true;$('empty').hidden=true;$('modulePlaceholder').hidden=true;$('detail').hidden=false;const detail=$('detail');const same=detailState.id===d.id;const table=detail.querySelector('.table-wrap');const tableScroll=table?.scrollTop||0;const main=document.querySelector('.main');const pageScroll=main.scrollTop;const pct=d.success_pct==null?'—':num(d.success_pct);const progress=Math.min(100,Math.max(0,(d.progress||0)*100));const actions=`${d.status==='running'||d.status==='waiting'?`<button class="btn danger" data-click-action="stopTask" data-arg0="${d.id}">停止</button>`:''}${['finished','stopped','error'].includes(d.status)?`<button class="btn" data-click-action="retryTask" data-arg0="${d.id}">重新测试</button><button class="btn" data-click-action="deleteTask" data-arg0="${d.id}">删除</button>`:''}${d.out_path?`<button class="btn" data-click-action="download" data-arg0="/download/${d.id}">下载 JSONL（逐行 JSON）</button>`:''}`;const actualLabel=d.status==='running'?'实时完成吞吐':'平均完成吞吐';const actualValue=d.status==='running'?d.rpm?.live:d.rpm?.avg;
detail.innerHTML=`<section class="overview-shell"><div class="hero"><div class="hero-main"><div class="eyebrow">${esc(statusNames[d.status]||d.status)} · ${esc(d.mode)}</div><div class="title-row"><h1>${esc(d.name)}</h1><span class="status ${d.status}">${esc(d.phase)}</span></div><div class="phase">${esc(d.model||'—')} · ${esc(d.target_url||'—')} · 实际运行 <span data-elapsed>${duration(d.elapsed)}</span>${d.planned_duration?` · 计划调度 ${durationPrecise(d.planned_duration)}`:''}</div></div><div class="hero-actions">${actions}</div></div>${artifactNotice(d)}${d.error?`<div class="notice">${esc(d.error)}</div>`:''}<section class="progress-card ${d.status}"><div class="progress-head"><div class="progress-copy"><strong>任务完成进度</strong><div>已收到 ${num(d.done,0)} 条结果 / 计划 ${num(d.total,0)} 条请求</div></div><div class="progress-num">${Math.round(progress)}<small>%</small></div></div><div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width:${progress}%"></div></div><div class="progress-foot"><span>已调度 ${num(d.scheduled,0)} · 已开始 ${num(d.started,0)} · 进行中 ${num(d.inflight,0)}</span><span>${d.status==='running'||d.status==='waiting'?`排队 ${num(d.pending,0)} · 计划剩余 ${num(d.remaining,0)}`:d.status==='finished'?'计划请求已全部完成':`未执行/未完成 ${num(d.dropped,0)}`}</span></div>${capacityNote(d)}</section><div class="summary"><section class="success-card"><div class="success-label">请求成功率</div><div class="success-number">${pct}<span>${d.success_pct==null?'':'%'}</span></div><div class="success-note">成功 ${num(d.counters?.ok,0)} / 已收到结果 ${num(d.done,0)}。仅完整的 2xx 响应计为成功。</div></section><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">${actualLabel}</div><div class="metric-value">${num(actualValue)}<small>RPM</small></div></div><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">计划调度速率</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.target_rpm)}<small>RPM</small></div></div><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">TTFT p95（首字耗时）</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.ttft?.p95)}<small>ms</small></div></div><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">调度延迟 p95</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.schedule_lag?.p95)}<small>ms</small></div></div></div></div></section><div class="cards"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><div class="card-title">失败分布</div><div class="card-sub">所有类别均来自客户端可观测结果</div></div></div><div class="error-grid">${errorItems(d)}</div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><div><div class="card-title">延迟概览</div><div class="card-sub">真实正文首字与完整响应耗时</div></div></div><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">TTFT p50</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.ttft?.p50)}<small>ms</small></div></div><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">TTFT p95</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.ttft?.p95)}<small>ms</small></div></div><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">总耗时 p50</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.total_ms?.p50)}<small>ms</small></div></div><div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">总耗时 p95</div><div class="metric-value">${num(d.total_ms?.p95)}<small>ms</small></div></div></div></section><section class="card wide"><div class="card-head"><div><div class="card-title">完成吞吐趋势</div><div class="card-sub">计划调度速率与实际完成速率是两个不同口径</div></div><div class="chart-legend"><span><i style="background:#3975ef"></i>完成 RPM</span><span><i style="background:#9cb8e8"></i>计划调度 RPM</span><span><i style="background:#df5b63"></i>失败 RPM</span></div></div><div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chart"></canvas>${d.timeline?.length?'':'<div class="chart-empty">等待更多数据后绘制趋势</div>'}</div></section><section class="card wide"><div class="card-head"><div><div class="card-title">最近请求</div><div class="card-sub">页面显示最近 100 条；下载文件包含全部已完成请求${d.config?.capture_raw?'及原始输入/输出':''}</div></div><div class="path" title="${esc(d.out_path||'')}">${esc(d.out_path||'')}</div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>档位</th><th>状态码</th><th>结果</th><th>TTFT</th><th>总耗时</th><th>原因</th>${d.config?.capture_raw?'<th>原始记录</th>':''}</tr></thead><tbody>${(d.recent||[]).length?d.recent.map(r=>`<tr><td>${num(r.id,0)}</td><td>${num(r.step,0)}</td><td>${num(r.status,0)}</td><td><span class="tag ${r.cls}">${esc(r.label)}</span></td><td>${num(r.ttft)} ms</td><td>${num(r.total)} ms</td><td title="${esc(r.reason||'')}">${esc(r.reason||'—')}</td>${d.config?.capture_raw?`<td><button class="raw-link" data-click-action="showRaw" data-arg0="${d.id}" data-arg1="${Number(r.id)}">查看</button></td>`:''}</tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="${d.config?.capture_raw?8:7}">尚无请求结果</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></div></section></div>`;detailState.id=d.id;requestAnimationFrame(()=>{main.scrollTop=same?pageScroll:0;const next=detail.querySelector('.table-wrap');if(next)next.scrollTop=same?tableScroll:0;drawChart(d.timeline||[]);const chartWrap=detail.querySelector('.chart-wrap');if(chartWrap&&window.chartResizeObserver){window.chartResizeObserver.disconnect();window.chartResizeObserver.observe(chartWrap)}})}
async function showRaw(taskId,itemId){const modal=$('rawModal');openModal('rawModal');$('rawTitle').textContent=`请求 #${itemId} 原始输入与输出`;$('rawInput').textContent='加载中…';$('rawOutput').textContent='加载中…';try{const d=await api(`/task/${taskId}/record/${itemId}`);$('rawInput').textContent=JSON.stringify(d.raw_input??null,null,2);$('rawOutput').textContent=d.raw_output||'（没有响应正文，例如连接失败或超时）'}catch(e){$('rawInput').textContent='读取失败';$('rawOutput').textContent=e.message}}
function closeRaw(){closeModal('rawModal')}
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){closeRaw();closeQualityEvidence();closeQualitySuite()}const tab=e.target.closest?.('.report-tab');if(!tab||!['ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','Home','End'].includes(e.key))return;const tabs=[...tab.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.report-tab')];const index=tabs.indexOf(tab);const next=e.key==='Home'?0:e.key==='End'?tabs.length-1:(index+(e.key==='ArrowRight'?1:-1)+tabs.length)%tabs.length;e.preventDefault();tabs[next].click();document.querySelectorAll('.report-tab')[next]?.focus()});
function drawChart(data){const c=$('chart');if(!c)return;const wrap=c.parentElement;if(!wrap)return;const rect=wrap.getBoundingClientRect(),dpr=window.devicePixelRatio||1,w=Math.max(80,Math.floor(rect.width)),h=Math.max(150,Math.floor(rect.height));c.width=Math.floor(w*dpr);c.height=Math.floor(h*dpr);c.style.width='100%';c.style.height='100%';const x=c.getContext('2d');x.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);x.clearRect(0,0,w,h);if(!data.length)return;const points=data.map(v=>({...v,rpm:Number(v.rpm)||0,target_rpm:Number(v.target_rpm)||0,failed:(Number(v.r429)||0)+(Number(v.r5xx)||0)+(Number(v.r4xx)||0)+(Number(v.timeout)||0)+(Number(v.network)||0)+(Number(v.protocol)||0)}));const max=Math.max(60,...points.flatMap(v=>[v.rpm,v.target_rpm,v.failed*60]));x.strokeStyle='#e3e8ef';x.fillStyle='#8290a3';x.font='10px sans-serif';for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){const y=12+(h-40)*i/4;x.beginPath();x.moveTo(45,y);x.lineTo(w-14,y);x.stroke();x.fillText(Math.round(max*(1-i/4)),4,y+3)}const px=i=>45+(w-59)*(points.length===1?.5:i/(points.length-1)),py=v=>h-28-(h-40)*(v/max);function line(key,color,width=2,dash=[]){x.strokeStyle=color;x.lineWidth=width;x.setLineDash(dash);x.beginPath();points.forEach((v,i)=>i?x.lineTo(px(i),py(v[key])):x.moveTo(px(i),py(v[key])));x.stroke();x.setLineDash([]);if(points.length===1){x.fillStyle=color;x.beginPath();x.arc(px(0),py(points[0][key]),Math.max(3,width+1),0,Math.PI*2);x.fill()}}line('target_rpm','#9cb8e8',1.5,[5,5]);line('rpm','#3975ef',2.6);line('failed','#df5b63',1.5);x.fillStyle='#8290a3';x.fillText('开始',45,h-8);x.fillText(`${points.length-1} 秒`,Math.max(45,w-52),h-8)}
async function stopTask(id){if(!confirm('停止后将取消尚未开始的排队请求；已经开始的请求会继续完成并写入结果。是否继续？'))return;try{await api('/task/'+id+'?stop',{method:'POST'});toast('正在停止任务');refresh()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}async function deleteTask(id){if(!confirm('确认删除任务？任务记录和它的结果文件会一起删除，删除后无法恢复，也无法再下载这次的结果。'))return;try{await api('/task/'+id+'?delete',{method:'POST'});showEmpty();refresh()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}async function deleteComparison(id){if(!confirm('确认删除这条对照实验记录？实验记录和它各实验组的结果文件会一起删除，删除后无法恢复。'))return;try{await api('/comparisons?delete='+encodeURIComponent(id),{method:'POST'});selectedComparison=null;toast('对照实验记录已删除');refresh()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}async function deleteQuality(id){if(!confirm('确认删除这条质量评测记录？评测记录和它的证据文件会一起删除，删除后无法恢复，报告也将无法复现。'))return;try{await api('/quality-tests?delete='+encodeURIComponent(id),{method:'POST'});selectedQuality=null;toast('质量评测记录已删除');refresh()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}async function retryTask(id){const key=window.savedApiKey?'':prompt('没有已保存的 API Key，请输入密钥。');if(!window.savedApiKey&&!key)return;try{const d=await api('/task/'+id+'?retry',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({api_key:key})});selected=d.task_id;detailState.id=null;toast('已创建重测任务');refresh()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
Object.assign(window,{renderQualityDetail,renderComparisonDetail,render,selectQuality,selectComparison,refresh,deleteComparison,deleteQuality,openAccountModal,closeAccountModal,logout});
if(window.ResizeObserver){window.chartResizeObserver=new ResizeObserver(()=>{const d=tasks.find(x=>x.id===selected);if(d)drawChart(d.timeline||[])})}document.querySelector('.app')?.scrollTo(0,0);window.scrollTo(0,0);showLoading();async function bootApp(){stopRefresh();if(!authenticated)return;try{await loadConfig()}catch(e){console.error('[init] config failed',e)}if(!authenticated)return;await refresh();if(authenticated&&$('authGate').hidden)refreshTimer=setInterval(()=>{const active=hasActiveRuns;if(!document.hidden&&Date.now()-lastPollAt>=(active?1400:30000))refresh()},1500)};window.FingerprintUI?.init();(async function boot(){const ok=await initAuth();if(ok)await bootApp()})();setInterval(()=>{const d=window.currentDetail;if(d&&(['running','waiting'].includes(d.status))){const el=d.elapsed+(Date.now()-window.detailReceivedAt)/1000;document.querySelectorAll('[data-elapsed]').forEach(n=>n.textContent=duration(el))}document.querySelectorAll('[data-live-elapsed]').forEach(n=>{const task=tasks.find(t=>t.id===selected);if(task&&(['running','waiting'].includes(task.status)))n.textContent=duration(Number(n.dataset.base||0)+(Date.now()-Number(n.dataset.stamp||Date.now()))/1000)})},250);window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{const d=tasks.find(x=>x.id===selected);if(d)drawChart(d.timeline||[])})

document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(!document.hidden)refresh()});

function setTheme(theme){document.documentElement.dataset.theme=theme;const button=$('themeToggle');if(button){button.textContent=theme==='dark'?'浅色模式':'深色模式';button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(theme==='dark'));}if(window.currentDetail)drawChart(window.currentDetail.timeline||[]);}
setTheme(localStorage.getItem('workbench_theme')||(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light'));
$('themeToggle')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const theme=document.documentElement.dataset.theme==='dark'?'light':'dark';localStorage.setItem('workbench_theme',theme);setTheme(theme)});

// Keep actual table headers for accessibility and attach labels for narrow-screen cards.
function labelComparisonCells(){for(const table of document.querySelectorAll('.comparison-result-table')){const labels=[...table.querySelectorAll('thead th')].map(th=>th.textContent.trim());for(const row of table.querySelectorAll('tbody tr'))[...row.cells].forEach((cell,index)=>{if(!cell.hasAttribute('data-label'))cell.dataset.label=labels[index]||''});}}
new MutationObserver(labelComparisonCells).observe(document.querySelector('.main'),{childList:true,subtree:true});
